Choose one weapon this model is equipped with: a daemonbreath spear, daemonbreath meltagun, twin daemonbreath meltagun or daemonbreath thermal cannon. That weapon:
- counts as a Relic for all rules purposes;
- loses all of its abilities;
- gets 1 added to its Strength;
- gets 2 added to its Damage.
